-1"/></td><td><rend>, ((est)) in der Zeile eingefügt, regulär notiert.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-abe81ca6-52cb-4c85-b932-00725266a214" endid="#m-7d9047ca-dbfc-42a2-a135-e25dc5bdc471" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((resultant)) (wie ((CT IX)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((resultans))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-e80640b2-7ebe-4c68-bef7-ac304a33b9b4" endid="#m-ff84ca79-e794-4b5d-8707-73f9651c880d"><table><tr><td><rend>((&lt;A&gt;dest))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Initiale nicht ausgeführt.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-ef6c755b-7b51-45ee-b115-4cced899d19b" endid="#m-4558fc65-0d1b-4486-a2e7-d549340dfb3e"><table><tr><td><rend>((Arche))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies ((Arce))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-102e73c1-d885-4804-91f7-f5d5d74638ff" endid="#m-c807e5f0-6dc6-4217-b62c-3f766970191e"><table><tr><td><rend>((| uerum))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Buchstaben ((uer-)) vermutlich am Rand zugefügt, regulär notiert.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-b89866f5-f744-47b2-bcf7-7ac3585ad0b6" endid="#m-1bf34b3e-63fc-493d-8e81-9d0beec5337f" corresp="#m-comment-7"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-7-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>2. Note ungewöhnlich klein, möglicherweise wegen Kollision mit dem Text.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot type="global-comment"><table><tr><td><rend>((40, 41, 38, 43, 44, 45, 60, 46, 62, 63, 64:)) Hexameter (((60, 64)) mit metrischen Fehlern).</rend></td></tr></table></annot></notesStmt><sourceDesc><source xml:id="wit-pa-1871"><bibl><identifier type="siglum">Pa 1871</identifier></bibl></source></sourceDesc></fileDesc><encodingDesc><appInfo><application version="0.9.1"><name>Monodi-Zero</name></application></appInfo></encodingDesc><workList><work><identifier>Pa 1871-10v-3</identifier><title>Adest alma virgo Maria</title><incip><incipText><p>Adest alm